  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reliable and Sustainable Solar Energy Access for the Indigenous Communities of Golden Stream and San Jose, Toledo District, Belize</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is: To provide opportunities for improved education and livelihoods, while reducing local community environmental impacts within Belizes Maya Golden Landscape (MGL) through renewable and reliable solar-based energy access.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
